WEBVTT

00:00:02.913 --> 00:00:03.516
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 1

00:00:04.587 --> 00:00:06.921
<v><b>A:</b></v> I like the multiculturalism.

00:00:07.588 --> 00:00:11.045
People from all over the world live in the US,

00:00:11.053 --> 00:00:14.723
and we live together happily. Usually.

00:00:16.903 --> 00:00:17.498
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 2

00:00:18.577 --> 00:00:20.493
<v><b>B:</b></v> For me, it’s the language.

00:00:21.103 --> 00:00:22.962
English is international.

00:00:23.751 --> 00:00:25.195
I speak English.

00:00:25.220 --> 00:00:26.696
You speak English.

00:00:27.204 --> 00:00:31.018
I’m lucky – I don’t have communication problems.

00:00:33.097 --> 00:00:33.692
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 3

00:00:34.780 --> 00:00:36.213
<v><b>C:</b></v> I like the coffee.

00:00:36.872 --> 00:00:39.594
I have a large cup every day.

00:00:40.502 --> 00:00:42.019
When I’m in a hurry,

00:00:42.496 --> 00:00:45.769
I go to the drive-through and buy it from my car.

00:00:47.915 --> 00:00:48.598
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 4

00:00:49.643 --> 00:00:51.397
<v><b>D:</b></v> I love the freedom.

00:00:51.706 --> 00:00:53.285
I wear what I want.

00:00:53.397 --> 00:00:54.837
I say what I want.

00:00:54.978 --> 00:00:56.422
I do what I want.

00:00:58.530 --> 00:00:59.292
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 5

00:01:00.330 --> 00:01:03.214
<v><b>E:</b></v> One thing I really like is the sports.

00:01:03.986 --> 00:01:07.383
I like all kinds, but I really like basketball.

00:01:08.263 --> 00:01:11.127
My favorite team is the Golden State Warriors.

00:01:11.627 --> 00:01:13.492
I watch their games on TV.

00:01:15.564 --> 00:01:16.319
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 6

00:01:17.351 --> 00:01:19.021
<v><b>F:</b></v> I like the freeways.

00:01:19.545 --> 00:01:22.989
They have a lot of car lanes and are very fast.

00:01:23.327 --> 00:01:26.898
It’s really easy to drive from one place to another.

00:01:29.032 --> 00:01:29.865
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 7

00:01:30.894 --> 00:01:35.331
<v><b>G:</b></v> I really like the weather here, especially in the fall.

00:01:36.013 --> 00:01:40.170
A good fall day is cool, but not too cold.

00:01:40.940 --> 00:01:45.505
Sometimes it rains, but it doesn’t rain every day.

00:01:47.593 --> 00:01:48.188
<v><b>Narrator:</b></v> 8

00:01:49.216 --> 00:01:50.838
<v><b>H:</b></v> I love the food.

00:01:51.346 --> 00:01:54.152
My boyfriend makes really good burritos,

00:01:54.484 --> 00:01:57.614
and the US has great Mexican restaurants!